#m2[While Japan’s school education values individuality, it also discourages behaviors that deviate from the standard.]

（16）彼女は猫を可愛がる#m1[かたわら]、犬に対してはなぜか冷たい。

#m3[她对猫表现得很可爱，但对狗却不知为何冷淡。]

#m2[She shows affection towards cats but seems strangely distant towards dogs.]

