#m3[又把喜欢的电视剧录失败了。]

#m2[Once again, I missed recording my favorite drama.]

（８）突然パソコンが動かなくなって申し込みし#m1[損なった]。

#m3[突然电脑不动了，报名失败了。]

#m2[My computer suddenly stopped working, and I missed the deadline for submitting the application.]

