#m3[就算再吃都不觉得减少了。]

#m2[No matter how much you eat, it doesn’t feel like it’s decreasing.]

（８）遊ん#m1[でも]遊ん#m1[でも]遊び足りない。

#m3[玩儿再多也觉着玩不够。]

#m2[No matter how much you play, it’s never enough.]

