#m2[A good teacher is someone who understands and supports their students.]

（５）名大#m1[というのは]、名古屋大学#m1[のことだ]。

#m3[名大就是名古屋大学。]

#m2[Meidai, short for Nagoya University, refers to Nagoya Daigaku.]

（６）「馬には乗ってみよ人には添うてみよ」#m1[とは]、何でも体験してみなければ分からない#m1[ということだ]。

#m3[所谓“路遥知马力日久见人心”，就是不管什么都要体验一下才能明白。]

#m2[The saying “Ride a horse and try, accompany a person and try” means that you won’t understand things fully until you experience them yourself.]

