#m2[From his expression, I can sense a great determination.]

（６）Ａ国では貧富の差が拡大し、二極化が案じ#m1[られて]いる。

#m3[A国贫富差距扩大，担心两极分化。]

#m2[In country A, the wealth gap is widening, and polarization is a concern.]

